    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa9\ud83c\udf7b <strong>Beer and Rush: Non-Vr Edition</strong> is a short game inspired by a real-life experience: after a few beers, I dreamed of desperately searching for a bathroom. Beer barrels chased me, I kept falling, and my friends couldn't stop laughing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Check out the non-VR version of the original 'Beer and Rush VR,' also on Steam!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strap in for a pee-rific adventure:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83c\udf0c\ud83d\udebd Get lost in the dreams as you search for the relief station\u2014a.k.a. the bathroom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f\ud83c\udfb8 Light up the night with <strong>lanterns</strong> in your virtual hands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83c\udfb6\ud83c\udf19 Jump through a moonlit level accompanied by Clair de Lune.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5\ud83c\udf7a And yes, you'll actually hear Clair de Lune and Gymnop\u00e9dies as you make that &quot;one small <strong>leap</strong> for man, but a <strong>giant sip</strong> for mankind.&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83c\udfa9\ud83c\udfb6Enjoy our <strong>original soundtrack </strong>  featuring rock and funk.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a surreal, beer-induced adventure that blurs the boundaries of dreams and reality!!! \ud83c\udfb5\ud83c\udf7b</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa9\ud83c\udf7b <strong>Beer and Rush: Non-Vr Edition</strong> is a short game inspired by a real-life experience: after a few beers, I dreamed of desperately searching for a bathroom. Beer barrels chased me, I kept falling, and my friends couldn't stop laughing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Check out the non-VR version of the original 'Beer and Rush VR,' also on Steam!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strap in for a pee-rific adventure:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83c\udf0c\ud83d\udebd Get lost in the dreams as you search for the relief station\u2014a.k.a. the bathroom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f\ud83c\udfb8 Light up the night with <strong>lanterns</strong> in your virtual hands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83c\udfb6\ud83c\udf19 Jump through a moonlit level accompanied by Clair de Lune.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5\ud83c\udf7a And yes, you'll actually hear Clair de Lune and Gymnop\u00e9dies as you make that &quot;one small <strong>leap</strong> for man, but a <strong>giant sip</strong> for mankind.&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83c\udfa9\ud83c\udfb6Enjoy our <strong>original soundtrack </strong>  featuring rock and funk.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a surreal, beer-induced adventure that blurs the boundaries of dreams and reality!!! \ud83c\udfb5\ud83c\udf7b</p>",
    "short_description": "Experience the hilarious 360\u00ba platformer, 'Beer and Rush: Non-VR Edition', where you must find a bathroom in a dream world after having a few beers. Based on a personal experience, this short game is a platformer packed with humor, great music, and challenges.",
